  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>Clan field gun Points crew rotary autocannons manufactured to Clan precision standards for extreme sustained fire rates. The Clan rotary mechanism achieves more consistent cycling and marginally reduced jamming compared to Inner Sphere versions, though the fundamental ammunition consumption and heat generation remain formidable. These Points provide suppressive firepower that can pin entire formations, and Clan logistics systems keep them supplied more reliably than most Inner Sphere field gun units can expect.</p>"
